# Find The Needle, German.
#
# An empty msgstr is not a bug: it means the string falls back to its message
# id, which is the English source text. That is why the ids are English and not
# keys. See docs/localization/PLAN.md.
#
# To bring this file up to date after the English has moved:
#     python scripts/dev/gen_pot.py --merge de
#
# That rebuilds locale/game.pot from the source and folds it in here. Every
# translation already written is kept, every new string arrives with an empty
# msgstr, and a string whose English has gone is moved to the bottom as a
# comment rather than deleted. Nothing written here is ever thrown away by it.
msgid ""
msgstr ""
"Project-Id-Version: Find The Needle\n"
"Language: de\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
"Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8\n"
"Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\n"
"Plural-Forms: nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);\n"

msgid "SMALL"
msgstr "KLEIN"

msgid "Designed for weaker computers. A shorter hunt with room to walk around the pile."
msgstr "Für schwächere Computer gemacht. Eine kürzere Suche mit Platz, um den Haufen herumzulaufen."

msgid "STANDARD"
msgstr "STANDARD"

msgid "The yard as it comes. The pile the game was built around, under one steel roof."
msgstr "Der normale Hof. Der Haufen, für den das Spiel gemacht wurde, unter einem Stahldach."

msgid "BIG"
msgstr "GROSS"

msgid "Twice the hay and a crown that stands over the wall plates. Bring a belt."
msgstr "Doppelt so viel Heu und eine Spitze, die über die Wände ragt. Du brauchst ein Band."

msgid "HUGE"
msgstr "RIESIG"

msgid "Eight storeys of straw. The shed goes out to meet it and the roof still loses. Slow to load."
msgstr "Acht Stockwerke Stroh. Die Halle wächst mit, und das Dach ist trotzdem zu niedrig. Lädt langsam."

msgid "THE MOUNTAIN"
msgstr "DER BERG"

msgid "Fifty metres. It does not fit under the roof, it is not supposed to, and you will not finish it. Takes a minute to pour."
msgstr "Fünfzig Meter. Er passt nicht unter das Dach, das soll er auch nicht, und du wirst nie damit fertig. Das Aufschütten dauert eine Minute."

